            /// <summary>
            /// BGR to YUV color conversion.<para/>
            /// Here is how NPP converts gamma corrected RGB or BGR to YUV. <para/>
            /// For digital RGB values in the range [0..255], Y has the range [0..255], U varies in the range [-112..+112], 
            /// and V in the range [-157..+157]. <para/>
            /// To fit in the range of [0..255], a constant value of 128 is added to computed U and V values, and V is then saturated.
            /// <para/>
            /// Npp32f nY =  0.299F * R + 0.587F * G + 0.114F * B; <para/>
            /// Npp32f nU = (0.492F * ((Npp32f)nB - nY)) + 128.0F; <para/>
            /// Npp32f nV = (0.877F * ((Npp32f)nR - nY)) + 128.0F; <para/>
